---
description: Use NestWeaver for structural codebase understanding
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

When exploring unfamiliar code, use the `brain_context` MCP tool with relevant symbol names as seeds.

Before modifying functions with many callers, use `brain_impact` to check blast radius.

For architecture questions, use `brain_guide`.

When working on a named project, use `project_context`.

After making changes, use `detect_changes` to assess risk.
